    "summary": "film.js把旧屋顶画面截成260px斜向条带，沿DIR交替滑出画外；新片名字形从1500px外按letterLand沿同一方向入场。",
    "mechanism": "film.js把旧屋顶画面截成260px斜向条带，沿DIR交替滑出画外；新片名字形从1500px外按letterLand沿同一方向入场。",
    "trigger": "时间轴到达T.shatter，旧屋顶开始分条滑走，片名字形按各自落点时刻进入。",
    "effect": "旧景拆开退场与新字形斜向入场交叠，沿统一切线完成从追逐场景到片名的交接。",
    "timing": [
      {
        "name": "原片重放区间",
        "value": "31.0–34.2秒；1倍速，总时长3.2秒。"
      }
    ],
    "parameters": [
      {
        "name": "旧景条带",
        "value": "film/film.js:319–334：snapRoof截取旧屋顶，n=11、k=−11…11、wS=260；每条以NRM定位并沿DIR滑动，d=ei(clamp((t−T.shatter−abs(k)*.02)/.75))*2600*(k%2?1:−1)，abs(d)>=2599后跳过。"
      },
      {
        "name": "新字形入场",
        "value": "film/film.js:304–317：letterLand(i)=T.shatter+BEAT*.75+i*(BAR−BEAT*.9)/14；每字从落点前.42秒开始，按tw(t)的12fps取姿，沿DIR从±1500px外ease-out入场，旋转余量为±1.2rad，片名切缝split=40。"
      },
      {
        "name": "斜线与节拍",
        "value": "film/title.js:CUT_ANG=30°，film/scenes.js:DIR=[sin(CUT_ANG),−cos(CUT_ANG)]、NRM=[cos(CUT_ANG),sin(CUT_ANG)]；film/story.js：BPM=132，T.shatter=B(18)=31.363636秒，T.title=B(19)=33.181818秒。"
      }
    ],
    "sourceFiles": [
      "demos/cases/lemo-spy-titles/film/film.js",
      "demos/cases/lemo-spy-titles/film/title.js",
      "demos/cases/lemo-spy-titles/film/scenes.js",
      "demos/cases/lemo-spy-titles/film/story.js"
    ],
    "locator": "snapRoof / sShatter / letterLand / drawTitle / CUT_ANG / DIR",
    "useCases": [
